@ [conversation_uuid] 01a02268-2614-7d80-9737-ea77f4aeacb1
@ [turn_uuid] 38296e2a-24a4-4378-be9b-b7d9c92f5fc5

& [Fault]
  + the first focused compile stopped because the workspace sha2 digest type does not implement LowerHex and the new helper attempted direct hexadecimal formatting

& [Containment]
  + compilation stopped before execution and no permit process network provider remote call or effect occurred

& [Resolution]
  + encode the digest through an explicit bounded byte loop into a preallocated String

& [Lesson]
  + digest display traits are dependency-version-specific; canonical hexadecimal encoding should depend only on the digest bytes
